  "two workspaces share the root: pubspec.yaml (members app, packages/localsend_isolates, packages/typed_isolates) and Cargo.toml (cli, packages/core, packages/localsend_isolates/rust, server)",
  "rust_lib_localsend_app is both the pub package in rust_builder and the Cargo crate in rust: both are referred to by root; the two Gradle builds named : are too, while :app is unique",
  "the Flutter app's Android build applies dev.flutter.flutter-gradle-plugin: Flutter reaches the Gradle unit :app through a plugin",
  "flutter_rust_bridge appears in both ecosystems: the Dart package in localsend_isolates and the =2.12.0 crate in packages/localsend_isolates/rust",
  "rust_builder/cargokit is a vendored copy of Cargokit with its own build_tool pubspec: it is build machinery, and its test dependency is not listed",
  "the public signaling server wss://public.localsend.org/v1/ws is a deployment of this repository's server crate, so it is not listed as an external service; the STUN server stun.localsend.org is",
  "in_app_purchase is marked [FOSS_REMOVE]: the store builds talk to Google Play Billing and the App Store, the FOSS build drops them",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
